# Mutation cases for what a host of a shared list checks before it takes anything in (ADR 0034):
# an operation (the entry it names, its author's role under it, the last number the log accepted of
# its device, the signature, its place in the device's chain, a fork of the chain, a stamp that goes
# back or that two writes have, the epoch it is judged under), what a host tells its machine and keeps as
# proof when a device's operations conflict, a checkpoint and the settlement the checkpoints make (the
# list, the entry, the writers and no other, the instant and digest, the heads), and the entries of the
# log that decide those (a linked device, an amendment, the destruction of an epoch's keys, a rival of an
# entry that is a fork only when the administrators signed it).
#
# Each case takes one of those checks away or weakens it, and the tests under study must turn red.
# A check no test notices is a check nothing holds in place.
#
# Run with `scripts/mutate sce-build/tests/mutations/a_host_holds_only_what_its_log_admits_rust.cases`.
#
# Anchors are literal slices of the source; an edit that moves one is reported INCONCLUSIVE with the
# anchor quoted, never as a pass.

mutation_tests -p sce-rust-trust --lib --test a_host_admits_what_its_members_signed --test a_host_keeps_the_content_from_the_hub --test a_host_settles_on_the_checkpoints_of_its_members --test a_person_has_devices_and_the_log_keeps_track_of_them --test a_list_holds_its_safety_properties_under_every_order_of_delivery --test a_host_refuses_a_chain_a_settlement_or_an_amendment_that_does_not_hold_together --test what_an_independent_review_found_stays_fixed
mutation_targets backends/rust/trust/src/trust.rs backends/rust/trust/src/chain.rs backends/rust/trust/src/membership.rs
mutation_oracles backends/rust/trust/tests/a_host_admits_what_its_members_signed.rs backends/rust/trust/tests/a_host_settles_on_the_checkpoints_of_its_members.rs backends/rust/trust/tests/a_person_has_devices_and_the_log_keeps_track_of_them.rs backends/rust/trust/tests/a_list_holds_its_safety_properties_under_every_order_of_delivery.rs backends/rust/trust/tests/a_host_refuses_a_chain_a_settlement_or_an_amendment_that_does_not_hold_together.rs backends/rust/trust/tests/what_an_independent_review_found_stays_fixed.rs

